onclusions and workspace-relative deliverables shared/tasks/live-hermes-hermes-42/output/step-one.json, shared/tasks/live-hermes-hermes-42/output/step-two.json, shared/tasks/live-hermes-hermes-42/output/step-three.json. Do not edit meta.json or submit via raw HTTP/legacy filesync. Do not release execution just to end the turn; the adapter persists final delivery.\nOutputs are durable in the task's shared object-storage output/ directory; pull them to your task output/ directory before submission. Do not create a new task or send messages to other members.\nThe external test driver will replace your container at a step boundary without sending any new Matrix message.\n",
